\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Barbershop · Downtown Vacaville</p>\n    <h1>Final Kuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Ang 5-star na barbershop ng downtown Vacaville. Malinis na gupit, masayang kuwentuhan, at mga barberong magaling sa mga bata.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>5.0 · 227 review sa Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg> Mag-book sa Booksy</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Final%20Kuts%2C%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Direksyon</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">5.0★ mula sa 227 review</a></li><li>Welcome ang walk-in</li><li>I-book ang barbero mo sa Booksy</li><li>Gupit pambata</li><li>May gupit kahit lampas sa oras</li><li>Downtown sa Merchant St</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Ang shop</p><h2>Good vibes sa Merchant Street.</h2><p>Ang Final Kuts ay barbershop sa downtown Vacaville na may 5.0 na rating mula sa mahigit 200 review. Masiglang ambiance, masayang kuwentuhan, at mga barberong hindi nagmamadali ang hatid namin.</p><p>Isama ang mga bata. Matiyaga ang mga barbero namin sa mga bata, mula sa unang gupit hanggang sa bagong fade. Mag-walk in, o pumili ng barbero at mag-book ng oras sa Booksy.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>5.0★</b><span>227 review</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>4</b><span>Barberong puwedeng i-book</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>Lampas sa oras</b><span>May available na gupit</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/booksy-cover.jpg\" alt=\"Logo ng Final Kuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Sa upuan</p><h2>Gupit at serbisyo</h2><p>Bawat barbero namin ay may sariling menu. Ito ang mga alok namin, kasama ang saklaw ng presyo ng mga barbero.</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit</h3><span class=\"price\">$40–$45+</span></div><p>Fade, taper, combover. Kasama ng ilang barbero ang balbas.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit at balbas</h3><span class=\"price\">$45–$50</span></div><p>Gupit na may line-up ng balbas o specialty cut na may balbas.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit pambata</h3><span class=\"price\">$35–$50</span></div><p>Basic at specialty na gupit pambata. Iba-iba ang edad at araw depende sa barbero.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Line-up / Balbas</h3><span class=\"price\">$25–$30</span></div><p>Buong line-up o balbas lang.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Razor shave at hot towel</h3><span class=\"price\">$65+</span></div><p>Buong razor shave, o ang “The final kut” na gupit na may razor face trim at hot towel.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit pambabae</h3><span class=\"price\">$45</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Kulay para sa uban</h3><span class=\"price\">$50</span></div><p>Pangkulay ng buhok para matakpan ang uban.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Shampoo at conditioner</h3><span class=\"price\">$30+</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Big chop</h3><span class=\"price\">$60+</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">10</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Lampas o bago ang oras</h3><span class=\"price\">$70+</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">11</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Buwanang membership</h3><span class=\"price\">$200</span></div><p>Lingguhang gupit na may balbas, regular na appointment, at hot towel massage.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">Iba-iba ang presyo depende sa barbero at maaaring magbago. I-tap ang barbero sa ibaba para makita ang buong menu niya.</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Ang team</p><h2>Pumili ng barbero</h2><p>Pumili ng barbero at mag-book online.</p></div><div class=\"team\"><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">H</div><div><h3>Hollywood The Barber</h3><p>Paul Pratt · Barbero</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 5.0 · 307 review</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">I-book si Hollywood →</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>Mga serbisyo at presyo</summary><ul><li><span>Regular na gupit panlalaki, walang balbas</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>Gupit panlalaki na may line-up ng balbas</span><b>$45+</b></li><li><span>Specialty panlalaki na may balbas</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>Specialty panlalaki, walang balbas</span><b>$45+</b></li><li><span>The final kut: gupit, razor face trim, hot towel</span><b>$65+</b></li><li><span>Specialty na gupit pambata</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>Mga batang 7–12, basic</span><b>$40+</b></li><li><span>Mga batang wala pang 6 (hindi Huw/Biy/Sab)</span><b>$40</b></li><li><span>Gupit pambabae</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>Pangkulay para sa uban</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>Shampoo at conditioner</span><b>$30+</b></li><li><span>Big chop</span><b>$60+</b></li><li><span>Gupit lampas sa oras</span><b>$70+</b></li></ul></details></article><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">P</div><div><h3>Patrick</h3><p>Barbero</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 4.9 · 58 review</p><p class=\"member-bio\">Ako si Patrick, barbero dito sa Vacaville. Espesyalidad ko ang fade, taper, combover, balbas at razor shave.</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-