><span>Gupit pambata (8 pataas)</span><b>$35</b></li><li><span>Line-up</span><b>$30</b></li><li><span>Specialty cut</span><b>$50</b></li></ul></details></article><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">L</div><div><h3>Luis</h3><p>Luis Morales · Barbero</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 5.0 · 11 review</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">I-book si Luis →</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/svt.fadez/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Luis on Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg> @svt.fadez</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>Mga serbisyo at presyo</summary><ul><li><span>Gupit</span><b>$40</b></li><li><span>Balbas</span><b>$25</b></li><li><span>Gupit at balbas</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>Gupit pambata</span><b>$35</b></li></ul></details></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mabuting malaman</p><h2>Mga amenity at patakaran</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Welcome ang walk-in</b></li><li><b>Online booking</b><span>Lahat ng barbero ay tumatanggap ng online appointment</span></li><li><b>Gupit pambata</b><span>Walang gupit ni Hollywood para sa wala pang 6 tuwing Huw–Sab</span></li><li><b>Tumatanggap ng credit card</b><span>Tumatanggap si Patrick ng card; tumawag para makasiguro sa ibang barbero</span></li><li><b>Paradahan</b></li><li><b>Accessible sa mga taong may kapansanan</b></li><li><b>Wi-Fi</b></li><li><b>Appointment lampas sa oras</b><span>Kay Hollywood at Patrick ($70+)</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p><h2>Mula sa shop</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"Taper fade, mula sa gilid\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/design-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Freestyle na disenyo sa buhok\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/skin-fade.jpg\" alt=\"Skin fade na may matalas na hati\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard-lineup.jpg\" alt=\"Line-up ng balbas sa shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/afro-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Hinubog na afro at line-up\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-side.jpg\" alt=\"Low fade, mula sa gilid\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-pair.jpg\" alt=\"Dalawang bagong fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chair.jpg\" alt=\"Upuan ng barbero sa Final Kuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga review</p><h2>Sabi ng aming mga customer</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 227 review</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 401 review</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Booksy →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best spot in town, hands down. No matter who you get, they&#39;re all great &amp; always take care of everyone that walks through the door. The atmosphere is lively &amp; the conversations are entertaining. I highly recommend everyone to check out Final Kuts.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Paul is professional, reliable and his shop is pleasant and very clean. He does an excellent job on my hair!!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Andrea · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My son doesn’t like getting haircuts and Patrick was very patient and understanding. The shop is clean and always good vibes when we visit.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great experience. My third time going in for a cut with Mare. Friendly, professional and attentive. I am very happy with the cut. Everyone in the shop is very friendly. Great place for a cut and shave. I recommend.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Rick · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1366045_marethebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Amare took our walk-in for my 1year old son’s mullet haircut and not only perfected exactly what I wanted, but also did it in a timely manner which is critically important when cutting a child’s hair! I’m very pleased! I think I’ve found my son’s barber!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great service Luis is an exceptional barber who pays attention to detail. I left feeling confident highly recommend”</blockquote><figcaption>— Peezy · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Andrew is an exceptional barber! He listened to what we needed and cut my son&#39;s hair perfectly- crisp and clean. The barbershop is friendly, comfortable professional and close to places to have a bite while you wait for someone.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Patrick is excellent! Super friendly and chill environment”</blockquote><figcaption>— Vincent · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593397_patrick_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“This is a great barber shop, friendly professional and great cuts. Great for walk ins..”</blockquote><figcaption>— Johnny C. · Yelp</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great atmosphere. My son got a regular hair cut from Paul. He was very attentive, asking questions to ensure he got what he wanted.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Arminthia S. · Yelp</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">FAQ</p><h2>Mga tanong, sinagot</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Puwede ba akong mag-walk in?</summary><p>Oo! Welcome ang walk-in, at nakagupit na rin kami ng walk-in na 1 taong gulang. Para hindi na maghintay, i-book online ang barbero mo.</p></details><details><summary>Paano ako magbu-book ng partikular na barbero?</summary><p>May sariling booking page ang bawat isa sa amin: Hollywood The Barber, Patrick, Marethebarber at Luis. I-tap lang ang mga Book button sa itaas.</p></details><details><summary>Magkano ang gupit?</summary><p>Ang karaniwang gupit panlalaki ay $40–$45, depende sa barbero. I-tap ang Book button ng barbero mo para sa kasalukuyang presyo.</p></details><details><summary>Gumugupit ba kayo ng buhok ng bata?</summary><p>Oo! Ang gupit pambata ay $35–$50. Tumatanggap si Mare ng mga batang 8 pataas, at walang gupit ni Hollywood para sa wala pang 6 mula Huwebes hanggang Sabado.</p></details><details><summary>May gupit ba kayo lampas sa oras?</summary><p>Oo. Gumugupit si Hollywood lampas sa oras sa halagang $70+, at si Patrick ay gumugupit bago o lampas sa oras sa halagang $70.</p></details><details><summary>Tumatanggap ba kayo ng card?</summary><p>Tumatanggap si Patrick ng credit card. Para sa ibang barbero, tawagan kami sa (707) 685-9136 para makasiguro.</p></details><details><summary>Anong oras kayo bukas?</summary><p>Bukas kami Lun 10 AM–6 PM, Mar–Biy 10 AM–7 PM at Sab 9 AM–6 PM, sarado tuwing Linggo. Puwedeng bahagyang magbago ang oras, kaya mag-book online o tumawag.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Bisitahin kami</p>\n      <h2>Oras at lokasyon</h2>\n      <address>348 Merchant St Ste A<br>Vacaville, CA 95688</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076859136\">(707) 685-9136</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>10 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miyerkules</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Huwebes</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Biyernes</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sabado</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Linggo</td><td>Sarado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Puwedeng bahagyang magbago ang oras, kaya mag-book online o tumawag para makasiguro.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/final_kuts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@final_kuts</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1090522654670466\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg><span>Booksy</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop